Work in the GitHub repository hiyroscript/alva.

Goal

Make the requested Alva menu, selection, HUD, pause, and Return Home UI elements use the exact same small rounded-corner treatment as the Play button on the Home Screen.

The Home Screen Play button is the visual source of truth.

In styles.css, .home-action currently uses:

border-radius: 3px;

Use 3px as the canonical outer corner radius for every element listed below.

This is a visual-consistency pass only. Do not redesign the screens, change their layouts, alter navigation/game logic, or change the Alva color system beyond the secondary-dialog-button background treatment described below.

Important implementation rule

Do not globally redefine --radius-sm, --radius-md, or --radius-lg to 3px. Those tokens are also used by unrelated UI that is not part of this request.

Either:

* introduce a narrowly scoped 3px radius token and apply it only to the requested components, or
* use 3px directly on the targeted selectors.

Keep the existing Home Play button visually unchanged.

