10. Validation

Run the existing tests after the change:

node --test tests/battle-screen.test.mjs
node --test tests/splash-screen.test.mjs

The battle test explicitly covers pause-menu/HUD/end-of-battle behavior, so it must continue to pass.

Then serve the game locally over HTTP and visually test the complete flow in a real browser because the existing tests do not validate CSS paint/layout:

python3 -m http.server 8000

Open the game, proceed from Home through Quick Battle, enter battle, open Pause, and open the Return Home confirmation.

Test at both desktop size and landscape mobile/tablet dimensions.

Definition of done

The task is complete when every specifically requested rectangular UI surface uses the Home Play button’s exact small 3px corner language, the specified active secondary dialog buttons have transparent resting backgrounds with white text, green primary buttons remain green, genuine disabled states remain distinguishable, and all existing game/navigation behavior continues to work.
